    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomized environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive magic causes various dungeon floors to take on the appearance of foreign environments with unique hazards such as volcanic caves, lush forests, arid deserts and more\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3d436547cd6af05827af0465a7918b79.poster.avif?t=1729406044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3d436547cd6af05827af0465a7918b79.webm?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3d436547cd6af05827af0465a7918b79.mp4?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect useful items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, collect and enhance various relics to help you fend off increasingly strong enemies while navigating the dungeon\u2019s floors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3efad9081141562738108a424e9b5d52.poster.avif?t=1729406044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3efad9081141562738108a424e9b5d52.webm?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3efad9081141562738108a424e9b5d52.mp4?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight unique enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off groups of enemies with a collection of unique abilities and attack patterns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/e3e5e018e2533dbd458a68380b8c0560.poster.avif?t=1729406044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/e3e5e018e2533dbd458a68380b8c0560.webm?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/e3e5e018e2533dbd458a68380b8c0560.mp4?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how you stack up against other adventurers exploring the dungeon.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomized environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive magic causes various dungeon floors to take on the appearance of foreign environments with unique hazards such as volcanic caves, lush forests, arid deserts and more\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3d436547cd6af05827af0465a7918b79.poster.avif?t=1729406044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3d436547cd6af05827af0465a7918b79.webm?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3d436547cd6af05827af0465a7918b79.mp4?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect useful items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, collect and enhance various relics to help you fend off increasingly strong enemies while navigating the dungeon\u2019s floors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3efad9081141562738108a424e9b5d52.poster.avif?t=1729406044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3efad9081141562738108a424e9b5d52.webm?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/3efad9081141562738108a424e9b5d52.mp4?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight unique enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off groups of enemies with a collection of unique abilities and attack patterns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/e3e5e018e2533dbd458a68380b8c0560.poster.avif?t=1729406044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/e3e5e018e2533dbd458a68380b8c0560.webm?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600290/extras/e3e5e018e2533dbd458a68380b8c0560.mp4?t=1729406044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how you stack up against other adventurers exploring the dungeon.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dungeon Croaker is a frog themed turn-based roguelike dungeon crawler. Navigate randomly generated dungeon floors, find and synergize relic effects, fight enemies with unique abilities, avoid dangerous environmental hazards, and defeat powerful dungeon bosses.",
